<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2676696844"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1796309865"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Ma Vie en Rose"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / 平野綾"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Song Collection from The Rose of Versailles"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:43.790"><div begin="00:01.471" end="03:28.212"><p begin="00:01.471" end="00:04.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">世界にあふれるきらめき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">充斥于这世界的璀璨光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ni a fu re ru ki ra me ki</span></p><p begin="00:08.976" end="00:12.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">ひとつ残らずこの手に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将全部紧握在我的手中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to tsu no ko ra zu ko no te ni</span></p><p begin="00:15.390" end="00:18.833" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">願いごと 皆かなうのよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中所愿都将就此实现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i go to mi na ka na u no yo</span></p><p begin="00:19.033" end="00:22.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">夜空飾る星の数ほど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多如装点夜空的繁星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra ka za ru ho shi no ka zu ho do</span></p><p begin="00:22.534" end="00:26.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">フリル ダイアモンド 好きなもの集めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将各种各样的蕾丝 钻石</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri ru da i a mo n do</span></p><p begin="00:26.222" end="00:30.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">シャンパーニュ ショコラ 楽しいことしたいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想恣意品尝香槟与巧克力的滋味</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha n pa a nyu sho ko ra</span></p><p begin="00:30.094" end="00:33.449" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">みんな集まってくるわ すぐに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家很快就会再次汇聚在一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na a tsu ma 't te ku ru wa su gu ni</span></p><p begin="00:33.881" end="00:37.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">この微笑みひとつだけで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要可以露出笑容那便足矣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ho ho e mi hi to tsu da ke de</span></p><p begin="00:37.348" end="00:41.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">しきたり ならわし 窮屈だけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">陈规旧例 传统习俗 会让人感到拘束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ki ta ri na ra wa shi kyu u ku tsu da ke re do</span></p><p begin="00:41.179" end="00:44.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">いつでもにぎやか お茶会 舞踏会<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但茶话会与舞会始终都这般热闹非凡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu de mo ni gi ya ka o cha ka i bu to u ka i</span></p><p begin="00:44.800" end="00:50.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">なんてすてきな la vie en rose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是多么美妙的玫瑰色生活啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te su te ki na la vie en rose</span></p><p begin="00:50.937" end="00:54.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Everything you see now here is mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻你目之所及的一切全部都为我所有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Everything you see now here is mine</span></p><p begin="00:54.261" end="00:57.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">約束された幸せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得到承诺时深感幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ku so ku sa re ta shi a wa se</span></p><p begin="00:58.060" end="01:00.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Yea, they all will follow me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们全都会追随于我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Yea they all will follow me</span></p><p begin="01:00.345" end="01:01.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm their star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是他们的明星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'm their star</span></p><p begin="01:01.687" end="01:05.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">足りないものは 何もない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的人生不曾有任何欠缺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i mo no ha na ni mo na i</span></p><p begin="01:05.812" end="01:13.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">誰も私のすべてに ときめき 恋してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世人都对我的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo wa ta shi no su be te ni</span></p><p begin="01:13.404" end="01:21.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">輝く祝福授けましょう 今<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻便赐予你辉煌的祝福吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya ku shu ku fu ku sa zu ke ma sho u i ma</span></p><p begin="01:29.172" end="01:32.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">望むもの 皆手に入る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望之物尽在掌握之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no zo mu mo no mi na te ni ha i ru</span></p><p begin="01:32.789" end="01:36.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">虹のティアラ 月のローブでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彩虹即为皇冠 月色织就长袍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ji no ti a ra tsu ki no ro o bu de mo</span></p><p begin="01:36.321" end="01:40.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">白百合 ばらも あでやかに咲いてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">白百何与玫瑰都绽放得娇艳欲滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ra yu ri ba ra mo a de ya ka ni sa i te ku</span></p><p begin="01:40.029" end="01:43.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ライラック マリーゴールド 醒めない夢の中で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有紫丁香以及万寿菊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra i ra 'k ku ma ri i go o ru do</span></p><p begin="01:43.933" end="01:47.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">みんな集まってくるわ ここに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们大家在此汇聚一堂吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na a tsu ma 't te ku ru wa ko ko ni</span></p><p begin="01:47.573" end="01:51.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">私の声聴くためだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为倾听我的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no ko e ki ku ta me da ke</span></p><p begin="01:51.333" end="01:54.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">ママからお小言 そんなの知らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妈妈絮叨的责备 与我没有任何关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ma ka ra o ko go to so n na no shi ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:55.034" end="01:58.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">私はオトナよ 飛べるの自由に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是个大人了 将自由自在高飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha o to na yo to be ru no ji yu u ni</span></p><p begin="01:58.629" end="02:04.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">なんてすてきな la vie en rose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是多么美妙的玫瑰色生活啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n te su te ki na la vie en rose</span></p><p begin="02:04.732" end="02:08.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Everything you see now here is mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻你目之所及的一切全部都为我所有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Everything you see now here is mine</span></p><p begin="02:08.175" end="02:11.833" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">約束された幸せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得到承诺时深感幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ku so ku sa re ta shi a wa se</span></p><p begin="02:11.833" end="02:14.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Yea, they all will follow me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们全都会追随于我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Yea they all will follow me</span></p><p begin="02:14.151" end="02:15.601" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I'm their star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是他们的明星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'm their star</span></p><p begin="02:15.601" end="02:19.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">でも足りないの 何かが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而我还是会觉得欲壑难填</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo ta ri na i no na ni ka ga</span></p><p begin="02:19.415" end="02:22.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Everything you see now here is mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻你目之所及的一切全部都为我所有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Everything you see now here is mine</span></p><p begin="02:22.943" end="02:26.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ずっとそう信じてきたけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来都对自己坚信不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to so u shi n ji te ki ta ke do</span></p><p begin="02:26.593" end="02:28.974" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Yea, they all will follow me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们全都会追随于我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Yea they all will follow me</span></p><p begin="02:28.974" end="02:30.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">I'm their star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是他们的明星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'm their star</span></p><p begin="02:30.329" end="02:34.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">でもちがうの 何かが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是莫名有一种违和感</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo chi ga u no na ni ka ga</span></p><p begin="02:34.501" end="02:41.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">誰も私のこの気持ちには 気づかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任谁都对我所怀揣的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo wa ta shi no ko no ki mo chi ni ha</span></p><p begin="02:41.978" end="02:49.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">心に空いた隙間 どうしてなの でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不知心中为何会产生空隙 但是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ni a i ta su ki ma do u shi te na no de mo</span></p><p begin="02:49.293" end="02:56.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">自分を信じているの 私は私よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对自己坚信不疑 我就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n wo shi n ji te i ru no wa ta shi ha wa ta shi yo</span></p><p begin="02:56.578" end="03:04.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">いつだってありのまま 思いのまま生きる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自始至终都将永葆自我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu da 't te a ri no ma ma</span></p><p begin="03:12.953" end="03:16.428" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Everything you see now here is mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻你目之所及的一切全部都为我所有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Everything you see now here is mine</span></p><p begin="03:16.428" end="03:18.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Yea, they all will follow me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们全都会追随于我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Yea they all will follow me</span></p><p begin="03:18.727" end="03:20.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">I'm their star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是他们的明星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I'm their star</span></p><p begin="03:20.192" end="03:23.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">ねえ 誰か私 見つけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 究竟谁能找到我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e da re ka wa ta shi mi tsu ke te</span></p><p begin="03:23.897" end="03:28.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">ここにいるのよ ひとり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就在这里 孤身一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni i ru no yo hi to ri</span></p></div></body></tt>